1
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,800
Oh God

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,800
We praise and glorify you

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,600
For your grace on South Sudan

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,900
Land of great abundance

5
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:24,300
Uphold us united in peace and harmony.

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,800
Oh motherland

7
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,900
We rise raising flag with the guiding star

8
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:35,000
And sing songs of freedom with joy;

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
For justice, liberty and prosperity

10
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,300
Shall forever more reign!

11
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,700
Oh great patriots

12
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:54,000
Let us stand up in silence and respect,

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Saluting our martyrs whose blood

14
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Cemented our national foundation,

15
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,300
We vow to protect our Nation.

16
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:14,000
Oh God, bless South Sudan!